{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based command battle RPG created with &quot;RPG Maker vx Ace&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently streaming up to the middle of Episode 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabriel comes to wake up Michael sleeping in his room in heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's my turn to look around today. Let's start before Metatron gets angry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story takes about 2 hours to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sub-event has over 10 hours of play time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >angel in action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loose conversation drama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >random encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digging for rare items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and grow freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ver1.30 supports English language. The menu is written in both Japanese and English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525750/extras/f6e37818504486f5e88137d36f6a829d.avif?t=1755345069\" width=544 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes factor (like a job) cheat. Makes combat easier and allows you to play like in an RPG-style novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525750/extras/86bde53422d368a0a483cfc80485631d.avif?t=1755345069\" width=544 height=416 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode 1 Synopsis</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, angels in Heaven have been going berserk. While on patrol, Michael and Gabriel are tasked with investigating the cause and travel to the place where the fallen angels, Grigori, were once sealed away. They find the Grigori nowhere to be found, and 20 fallen angels have escaped. This is a major incident, but with no end in sight to the angels' rampage, Raphael and Uriel join them as they begin a search for clues. But...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode 2 Synopsis</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The angels search for the escaped Grigori. Raguel and Iofiel report that they have caught him. Upon receiving a report that one of the fallen angels has returned to the place of his sealing, they begin an investigation. However, it turns out to be a trap set by the Grigori.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525750/extras/ff18b2df0bd4cd9f6b5e7e49fd798c18.avif?t=1755345069\" width=544 height=416 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525750/extras/209c61b997cfa7fa5188dab571be1f35.avif?t=1755345069\" width=544 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does not support STEAM overlays, cloud saves, achievements, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller operation does not support operation using the cross key.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2525750?t=1755345069","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755345069","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755345069","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755345069","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content